This repository is a reverse-engineering research corpus. It contains three
distinct categories of material, each under its own terms:

1. Original documentation, analysis prose, catalogs, inventories, coverage
   data, cross-references, extracted interface schemas and all other
   human-authored text in docs/, evidence/*.json, evidence/*.jsonl and the
   repository's root Markdown files are licensed under the Creative Commons
   Attribution 4.0 International License (CC-BY-4.0).

   SPDX-License-Identifier: CC-BY-4.0
   Full text: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode

2. Software in tools/ (the corpus browser and any accompanying scripts
   authored by the repository owner) is licensed under the MIT License:

