   SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT

3. Reconstructed C pseudocode, disassembly listings, PE metadata and extracted
   strings, descriptors and resources under evidence/decompiled/,
   evidence/disassembly/, evidence/pe/, evidence/strings/, evidence/protobuf/,
   evidence/embedded_json/, evidence/js/, evidence/text/ and
   docs/routines/ are derivative analysis artifacts produced from software
   distributed by NVIDIA Corporation and third-party vendors. The underlying
   software remains the property of its respective copyright holders. These
   artifacts are published for the purposes of interoperability research,
   security research, education and scholarship, which the authors believe to
   be permitted by applicable fair-use and research exceptions, including
   17 U.S.C. § 107, Directive (EU) 2019/790 Articles 3 and 4, and comparable
   provisions in other jurisdictions.

   No claim of copyright is made over the underlying NVIDIA or third-party
   software. Third-party license notices distributed with the original
   software are preserved in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.txt. Trademarks referenced
   in this repository (including NVIDIA, GeForce, CUDA, DLSS, Ansel,
   ShadowPlay, FrameView, GameStream and related marks) remain the property
